    "contracts": [
      "Typed logical handler ABI; physical dispatch table and frame derivation only at emission boundary",
      "Retained program-load source/body lifetime/type/width and frame/window/class/type/write slot metadata",
      "Source positions, exact integer literals, dense finite integer value and target IDs",
      "Verification and pruning retain dispatch-only operands and exact types",
      "Admitted invalid signatures or unsupported bodies fail; no silent direct fallback",
      "Graph image consumers reject native-system graphs; unmanaged profile rejects borrowed/pinned/affine ownership"
    ],
    "emission": "Mechanical graph IDs, block parameters and jump operands. No semantic SSA reconstruction in CLIF. compileDirectFunction remains the named temporary path for other functions.",
